    style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%"
    title="Verizon | Halo Winter Invitational Trailer"
  ></iframe>
</div>

<div>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <div>
    <p class="big">The Challenge</p>
    <p>Verizon's All-Access campaign needed a tournament that would stand out on a crowded esports calendar. We wanted a competitive experience that combined traditional esports gameplay with custom game modes that viewers would want to share.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="big">The Solution</p>
    <p>We designed a winter-themed, Code Red branded Halo event with standard competitive play and custom challenges. One custom game mode we developed, Warthog Sumo, added a social element to the competition.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="big">The Impact</p>
    <p>The event drove 500K+ social impressions for Verizon, and participating influencers including DrLupo, LEGIQN, Kurt Benkert and Gigz posted a large amount of their own content.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

