    <div class="side-by-side">
      <div>
        <p class="big">The Challenge</p>
        <p>
          Hi-Chew wanted to reach gaming audiences through Code Red, but unlike Verizon it had no history in esports. We needed a natural way to introduce Hi-Chew to the Fortnite scene.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="big">The Solution</p>
        <p>We designed a tournament with LEGIQN, a popular gaming personality, and made him the face of the event. The branding felt natural, and Hi-Chew gained a connection to his community. </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="big">The Impact</p>
        <p>Hi-Chew was pleased with the campaign's performance and invited LEGIQN to become a brand ambassador, which turned a one-time sponsorship into an ongoing partnership.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

